          <div class="conn-card" id="cc-casb">
            <div class="conn-card-head">
              <div class="conn-status cs-pending" id="cs-casb">Not connected</div>
              <div class="conn-card-title">CASB / Proxy Traffic Scanner</div>
              <div class="conn-card-sub">Zscaler · Netskope · Palo Alto Prisma</div>
            </div>
            <div class="conn-body">
              <div class="conn-desc">Ingests CASB or web proxy logs to detect traffic to hosted AI platforms — the most reliable way to find Claude agents on Dify, Voiceflow, or claude.ai Projects. Shows upload volume and user identity for each hosted agent session.</div>
              <div class="conn-fields">
                <div class="field-row"><label class="field-lbl">CASB platform</label>
                  <select class="field-inp" id="ci-casb-type"><option value="zscaler">Zscaler</option><option value="netskope">Netskope</option><option value="prisma">Palo Alto Prisma</option><option value="proxy">Generic proxy (Squid / Bluecoat)</option></select>
                </div>
